      "product_summary": "Men wide toe box Mesh lace-up walking shoes for B2B footwear assortments. Black and White Orange each offered in EU39-46. The photographs show elongated forefoot mesh openings, curved gray side patterns, flat woven laces, front and heel pull tabs, and a sculpted sole transitioning to a white heel. Upper is Mesh and outsole is PU according to the supplier material specification; separate midsole and lining compositions are not specified. Send color, exact EU size mix, pair quantity, packaging needs and destination for a wholesale quotation. Samples, branding feasibility, costs and dispatch timing require order-specific confirmation.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
